                                        <span>TOR ONION V3</span>
                                    </span>
                                </div>
                                <a href="https://github.com/Shiftyczech/TorE2EE_Messenger" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono" title="View Source on GitHub">
                                    <i class="fa-brands fa-github text-base"></i>
                                    <span>Shiftyczech/TorE2EE_Messenger</span>
                                </a>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Title & Subtitle -->
                            <div class="space-y-2">
                                <h4 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
                                    TorE2EE Messenger
                                </h4>
                                <p class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400/90 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1">
                                    <span>&gt; Zero Clearnet Footprint</span>
                                    <span>•</span>
                                    <span>Double Ratchet / X3DH</span>
                                    <span>•</span>
                                    <span>Rust Axum Relay</span>
                                    <span>•</span>
                                    <span>Android APK Release</span>
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Detailed Description -->
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed" data-en="A full-stack privacy-first messaging architecture operating entirely over the Tor network without clearnet fallback. Implements Signal Protocol cryptographic primitives (X3DH key agreement, Double Ratchet, AEAD Secretbox encryption), SQLCipher local encrypted database, zero DNS-leak SOCKS5 routing, and a hardened containerized Rust backend hidden behind Tor v3 services." data-cs="Full-stack komunikační systém zaměřený na maximální soukromí fungující výhradně v síti Tor bez přístupu do clearnetu. Využívá kryptografické prvky Signal protokolu (X3DH, Double Ratchet, AEAD Secretbox), lokálně šifrovanou databázi SQLCipher, SOCKS5 směrování bez úniků DNS a zabezpečený kontejnerizovaný backend v Rustu běžící za skrytou službou Tor v3.">
                                A full-stack privacy-first messaging architecture operating entirely over the Tor network without clearnet fallback. Implements Signal Protocol cryptographic primitives (X3DH key agreement, Double Ratchet, AEAD Secretbox encryption), SQLCipher local encrypted database, zero DNS-leak SOCKS5 routing, and a hardened containerized Rust backend hidden behind Tor v3 services.
                            </p>

                            <!-- Architecture / Highlights Feature Grid -->
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
                                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950/70 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i>
                                        <span class="font-bold">E2EE Cryptography</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400" data-en="Signal Double Ratchet, X3DH key exchange, and AEAD Secretbox forward secrecy." data-cs="Signal Double Ratchet, X3DH výměna klíčů a AEAD Secretbox pro dopřednou bezpečnost.">
                                        Signal Double Ratchet, X3DH key exchange, and AEAD Secretbox forward secrecy.
                                    </p>
                                </div>

                                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950/70 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400">
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
                                        <span class="font-bold">Zero DNS Leak</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400" data-en="RFC 1928 SOCKS5 client bridge directing all HTTP &amp; WS packets through Tor 127.0.0.1:9050." data-cs="RFC 1928 SOCKS5 klientský můstek směrující veškerý HTTP a WS provoz přes Tor 127.0.0.1:9050.">
                                        RFC 1928 SOCKS5 client bridge directing all HTTP &amp; WS packets through Tor 127.0.0.1:9050.
                                    </p>
                                </div>

                                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950/70 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
                                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-purple-400">
                                        <i class="fa-brands fa-rust"></i>
                                        <span class="font-bold">Rust Sidecar Backend</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400" data-en="Axum relay daemon isolated in Docker; non-root user, zero open ports exposed to clearnet." data-cs="Axum relay daemon izolovaný v Dockeru; non-root uživatel a žádné otevřené porty do clearnetu.">
                                        Axum relay daemon isolated in Docker; non-root user, zero open ports exposed to clearnet.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Tech Stack Pills -->
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2">
                                <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-dark-950 text-slate-300 border border-gray-800"><i class="fa-brands fa-rust text-orange-400 mr-1.5"></i>Rust (Axum)</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-dark-950 text-slate-300 border border-gray-800"><i class="fa-brands fa-react text-cyan-400 mr-1.5"></i>React Native</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-dark-950 text-slate-300 border border-gray-800"><i class="fa-brands fa-js text-yellow-400 mr-1.5"></i>TypeScript</span>
                                <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-dark-950 text-slate-300 border border-gray-800"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-purple-400 mr-1.5"></i>Tor Onion v3</span>
